@baseUrl = http://localhost:5150

### 1. Get all cards
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Cards
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get Level 1 cards (6 pairs) - Route Constraint :int:range(1,2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Cards/level/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Level 2 cards (10 pairs) - Route Constraint :int:range(1,2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Cards/level/2
Accept: application/json

### 4. Add a new Card (POST - [FromBody])
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Cards
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "كأس البطولة",
  "icon": "🏆",
  "category": "رياضة",
  "accentColor": "#14b8a6",
  "levelDifficulty": 1,
  "isActive": true
}

### 5. Get all Players (with 1:1 Profile, 1:N GameSessions, N:M Achievements)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Players
Accept: application/json

### 6. Search Players by alphabetical keyword - Route Constraint :alpha
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Players/search/sara
Accept: application/json

### 7. Get Paged GameSessions ([FromQuery] parameters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/GameSessions/paged?pageIndex=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 8. Record a new GameSession (POST - [FromBody])
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/GameSessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": 1,
  "level": 1,
  "pairsCount": 6,
  "attempts": 8,
  "timeElapsedSeconds": 24,
  "score": 1150,
  "isCompleted": true
}

